{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测异常 O_TMPFILE 用法。对应需求：无文件执行。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux疑似O_TMPFILE无文件落地执行","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nopen 使用 O_TMPFILE 创建匿名文件。\n\n### 为何重要\n载荷可不出现在常规目录。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://github.com/MatheuZSecurity/Dntry","https://matheuzsecurity.github.io/hacking/fileless-loader-bypassing-elastic-memfd/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"6fdd522d-421c-49f5-884e-0f278c388276","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 无文件执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and\nprocess.executable regex \"\"\".*/\\#[0-9]+.*\"\"\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1036.005","name":"Match Legitimate Resource Name or Location","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field